 Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나요","audio":"/audio/208badeaa54755540b4c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头发","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"生长在头上的毛发。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"样子，形状","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62397","definition":"与某物相同或相似的模样。","pronunciation":["모양"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a370a492e68f739e0b81.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67635-1-10-2","ko":"부분 염색으로 머리를 알록달록하게 만드는 게 유행이에요.","zh":"现在流行用挑染把头发染成五颜六色的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"부분","meaning":"部分","explanation":"부분：部分。","readings":[{"term":"부분","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65853","senseId":"1","lemma":"부분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부분","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3"}},{"text":"염색으로","meaning":"染色","explanation":"염색：染色；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"염색","audio":"/audio/9ea29c460c3fc8a315a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67635","senseId":"1","lemma":"염색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"염색으로","audio":"/audio/7ce6076d2d0462c81a50.mp3"}},{"text":"머리를","meaning":"头发","explanation":"머리：头发；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"3","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리를","audio":"/audio/7100300a7b419bcb6fd3.mp3"}},{"text":"알록달록하게","meaning":"斑斓，斑驳，花花绿绿","explanation":"알록달록하다：斑斓，斑驳，花花绿绿；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"알록달록하다","audio":"/audio/709cec9ca6bd0b2e2110.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66767","senseId":"1","lemma":"알록달록하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알록달록하게","audio":"/audio/d2eeab3222a7bc50d9b0.mp3"}},{"text":"만드는","meaning":"弄成，使成为","explanation":"만들다：弄成，使成为；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"12","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만드는","audio":"/audio/5ace588de32e5a309a75.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"유행이에요.","meaning":"流行，时尚，时髦","explanation":"유행：流行，时尚，时髦；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"유행","audio":"/audio/4e036fa50e83b243700b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70900","senseId":"1","lemma":"유행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유행이에요","audio":"/audio/58824082080511c47b01.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"204cbadbdb5dd2ee","term":"부분","zh":"部分","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3","entryId":"65853","definition":"构成整体的小范围；或指把整体分为多个时的其中一个。","pronunciation":["부분"]},{"id":"9ea29c460c3fc8a3","term":"염색","zh":"染色","audio":"/audio/9ea29c460c3fc8a315a8.mp3","entryId":"67635","definition":"在布料、线、头发等上染上颜色。","pronunciation":["염ː색"]},{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头发","au